<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86641" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προαπο-θνήσκω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>die before</i> or <i>first,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>Mith.</u>
				117
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τῆς γηραιοῦ τελευτῆς</span>
			<i>die before</i> old age, <i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				4.1.2
			</span></i>; of a coward, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ὑπὸ τοῦ
			φόβου,</span> i.e. before his time, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				3.1.25
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τῷ δέει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.68
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. πρὶν ἐντὸς βέλους γενέσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Anach.</u>
					25
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>die on behalf</i> or <i>in defence of,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὲρ τῆς βασιλείας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					208d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν τέκνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EE</u>
					1235a34
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύνες π. τῶν δεσποτῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.200
				</span></i>
			.</div>
